	(descr "Murata DFE252012F / DFE252012P metal alloy power inductor, 2.5x2.0x1.2 mm (1008). Land pattern per Murata reference specification JETE243A-0017: two 0.8x2.0 mm lands, 1.2 mm gap. Murata asks for no vias or other copper under the coil. LCSC C703140 (DFE252012F-R47M=P2), alternative C237552 (DFE252012P-R47M=P2).")
